WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:05.400
Jordan Lee: Hey everyone, thanks for joining. Can you all hear me okay?

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Lee Park: Yep, we can hear you fine.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Lee Park: So um the big thing for us is disaster recovery. We have no secondary site today and our auditors flagged it, so we need an RPO of one hour for about 200 VMs.

4
00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Jordan Lee: Got it. NC2 on AWS could be a really good fit there. What does your current environment look like?

5
00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Lee Park: We're running vSphere 8 on six HPE hosts, with Veeam for backup. Budget is tight this year though, so cost is a concern.

6
00:00:43.000 --> 00:00:55.000
Jordan Lee: Makes sense. I'll put together a sizing for NC2 DR by Friday, and I'll send you the TCO comparison as well.

7
00:00:56.000 --> 00:01:05.000
Jordan Lee: Could you send us an RVTools export of the environment so we can size it accurately?

8
00:01:06.000 --> 00:01:12.000
Lee Park: Sure, I can get that to you tomorrow.

9
00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:22.000
Jordan Lee: Great. Let's plan a follow-up call next Thursday to walk through the design with your team.

10
00:01:23.000 --> 00:01:26.000
Lee Park: Sounds good, talk soon.
